# ThreadSanitizer suppressions (M22, D-072). Each entry names code TSan cannot
# see the synchronisation of, with the reason. Keep this list short.
#
# rte_hash's lock-free lookup pairs its key compare with a version counter
# read in DPDK code built without TSan instrumentation; TSan sees only the
# BESS-side compare of the key bytes (decisions.md, M9 TSan run).
race:CmpFixed
# rte_ring (DPDK 25.11): the consumer orders its element copy after the
# producer's with a relaxed tail load and a standalone acquire fence, which
# ThreadSanitizer does not model; it reports the copy itself. The handoff
# channel's own counters, ownership and packets stay instrumented.
race:__rte_ring_dequeue_elems
